@startuml cu13
!theme plain
title CU13 — Eliminar persona

actor "Escribano" as Actor
participant "Notaire system" as System

Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) decides to delete a person.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Requests: (First name; Last name; Identification type and number)
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) enters the search data.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Looks up and presents a list of people.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The notary (Escribano) selects a person and confirms the deletion.
System -> System : Escribano
Actor -> Actor : Deletes the selected person.
System -> System : System

@enduml